still life lighting), \"运动追焦\" (motion tracking), \"逆光人像\" (backlit portrait), \"雨天反光\" (rain reflection), \"夜景曝光\" (night exposure), \"室内白平衡\" (indoor white balance), \"微距景深\" (macro depth of field), \"街头构图\" (street composition), \"风光滤镜\" (landscape filter), \"儿童抓拍\" (children candid shots)\n\nAnd content types embedded in descriptions:\n- \"条件与原理\" (conditions and principles) - matches interest (imaging principles, adjustments under conditions)\n- \"操作记录\" (operation records) - matches interest (actual shooting methods)\n- \"概念速览\" (concept overview) - matches interest (learning)\n- \"专题观察\" (special topic observation) - about photography exhibitions, curator clues, author biographies, artwork history - this is more about art history/viewing experience, less aligned with shooting methods\n- \"市场观察\" (market observation) - about camera purchase packages, channel promotions, celebrity endorsements - this is EXACTLY what the user does NOT want (器材促销/equipment promotions)\n\nSo the user explicitly does not want 器材促销 (equipment promotions) or 摄影师私生活 (photographer private lives).\n\nThe \"市场观察\" content type is about camera purchase packages, channel promotions, celebrity endorsements - this is equipment promotion content. Should be excluded.\n\nThe \"专题观察\" content is about photography exhibitions, curator clues, author biographies, artwork history - this is more about art history and viewing experience, not actual shooting methods. This is less aligned with the interest which focuses on actual shooting methods, imaging principles, and adjustments.\n\nThe interest explicitly says: 关注实际拍摄方法、成像原理与不同条件下的调整 (focus on actual shooting methods, imaging principles, and adjustments under different conditions).\n\nSo the best matches are:\n- \"条件与原理\" (conditions and principles) - imaging principles and adjustments under conditions\n- \"操作记录\" (operation records) - actual shooting methods\n- \"概念速览\" (concept overview) - learning concepts\n\nThe \"专题观察\" (exhibition/art history) and \"市场观察\" (market/equipment promotion) are less aligned or explicitly excluded.\n\nLet me count the candidates by type. I need 20 total.\n\nLet me identify the candidates that match the interest well (条件与原理, 操作记录, 概念速览) and exclude 市场观察 (equipment promotion) and 专题观察 (art history/exhibitions).\n\nLet me list all candidates and categorize:\n\n1. item-014950ee574d - 静物布光 低照度室内 市场观察 - EXCLUDE (market)\n2. item-03a565217024 - 运动追焦 窗边自然光 专题观察 - EXCLUDE (exhibition)\n3. item-03b7af37b88f - 逆光人像 黄昏户外 条件与原理 - INCLUDE\n4. item-04f2ff24ab7e - 雨天反光 窗边自然光 条件与原理 - INCLUDE\n5. item-061d97575247 - 夜景曝光 阴天街道 条件与原理 - INCLUDE\n6. item-064ccfdc15e3 - 室内白平衡 窗边自然光 专题观察 - EXCLUDE\n7. item-07bfbf16235d - 微距景深 低照度室内 市场观察 - EXCLUDE\n8. item-090691086c5b - 夜景曝光 低照度室内 市场观察 - EXCLUDE\n9. item-09e96ac6aea0 - 微距景深 黄昏户外 概念速览 - INCLUDE\n10. item-0a19145321ef - 街头构图 窗边自然光 专题观察 - EXCLUDE\n11. item-0b78ff27e538 - 微距景深 阴天街道 市场观察 - EXCLUDE\n12. item-0ca34ef0a880 - 夜景曝光 阴天街道 概念速览 - INCLUDE\n13. item-10d5a61a7f0a - 雨天反光 窗边自然光 操作记录 - INCLUDE\n14. item-11c4e3cb9cf2 - 街头构图 黄昏户外 专题观察 - EXCLUDE\n15. item-11d6f8fe3226 - 街头构图 低照度室内 专题观察 - EXCLUDE\n16. item-12a571ccfc9e - 逆光人像 阴天街道 操作记录 - INCLUDE\n17. item-143c3c5732d6 - 室内白平衡 窗边自然光 市场观察 - EXCLUDE\n18. item-16a7440356e6 - 静物布光 窗边自然光 专题观察 - EXCLUDE\n19. item-1a2494e4589c - 逆光人像 阴天街道 条件与原理 - INCLUDE\n20. item-1b824b8d4dec - 风光滤镜 低照度室内 概念速览 - INCLUDE\n21. item-1b9b39a7ef86 - 儿童抓拍 阴天街道 概念速览 - INCLUDE\n22. item-2044482a2166 - 雨天反光 黄昏户外 专题观察 - EXCLUDE\n23. item-2130f01f2f2c - 风光滤镜 低照度室内 条件与原理 - INCLUDE\n24. item-224628e85f98 - 逆光人像 阴天街道 概念速览 - INCLUDE\n25. item-225af9fad31a - 室内白平衡 阴天街道 操作记录 - INCLUDE\n26. item-2272238187d9 - 静物布光 阴天街道 概念速览 - INCLUDE\n27. item-23de96f8a693 - 夜景曝光 窗边自然光 专题观察 - EXCLUDE\n28. item-24351a134f2a - 街头构图 阴天街道 概念速览 - INCLUDE\n29. item-2589e00e0e34 - 微距景深 低照度室内 操作记录 - INCLUDE\n30. item-258cf26f5a90 - 静物布光 低照度室内 概念速览 - INCLUDE\n31. item-2591e5ddcc17 - 微距景深 窗边自然光 操作记录 - INCLUDE\n32. item-274920178d43 - 儿童抓拍 黄昏户外 操作记录 - INCLUDE\n33. item-287b